  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Fishing Fever
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_JACKPOT_SYMBOL
    value: <style=title><size=32>JACKPOT SYMBOL</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_JACKPOT_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      Jackpot Symbol appears with Grand, Mega, Major, Minor
      or Mini Jackpot.

      Jackpot Symbol landing within a Win Box awards the
      Jackpot written on it.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER SYMBOL</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION
    value: "<size=16>\nScatter Symbol appears on all reels and if ladning in a Win
      Box fills up Fishing Fever Gauge and accumulate a portion of Total Bet to Bonus
      Bet. \n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_FISHING_FEVER_GAUGE
    value: <style=title><size=32>FISHING FEVER GAUGE & BONUS BET</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_FISHING_FEVER_GAUGE_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      Players in the same game room shares one Fishing Fever
      Gauge.

      Once players fully fills up a Gauge together, they can trigger
      Fishing Fever Bonus.

      The greater contributioin, the greater Bonus Bet,

      Players
      have their on Bonus Bets, proportioinal to one''s contribution.

      Bonus
      Bet will be used as Base Bet for Fishing Fever Bonus.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_FISHING_FEVER_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=32>FISHING FEVER BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_FISHING_FEVER_BONUS_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      Once Fishing Fever Gauge is fully filled, all players
      in the same game room enter Fishing Fever Bonus.

      During Bonus, Win Box
      appears with x2, x3, x5, or x10.

      The Win Box can appear in up to 3x3
      size.

      Fish Symbols appear with x1, x2, x3, x5 or x10.

      If a Fish
      Symbol lands within a Win Box, then the multiplier of Fish Symbol gets upgraded,
      multiplied by the multiplier of Win Box.

      Every spin, multipliers from
      Fish Symbols are added to the Total Multiplier Panel.

      Once there are
      no remaining spins, Total Multiplier will be multiplier to the Bonus Bet and
      gets paid.

      +1 Spin Symbol anywhere on reels awards additional free spin.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WIN_BOX
    value: <style=title><size=32>WIN BOX</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WIN_BOX_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      Win Box appears on a random position in one of the following
      sizes below.

      Only when symbols land on a Win Box, pays are awarded and
      contribute to Bonus Bet.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>

      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>

      </size></b>'
